  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/061075dac7ea4774504fcd99d877301922d87334.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252ftokimi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3d91f2f164c38a7aca00524f3629e101eed9db38.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h1><strong>🐾Squish</strong></h1>\n<h1>讓你的生物永遠保持幼崽模樣，帶著甜美的風格！</h1>\n<hr>\n<h1><strong>📝關於</strong></h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qHB5D9uzHe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d126ae4be2a40425b3b4c8a772552f7c140b2e66.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fsquish%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/688047102278c26706e89bb2a2afa0d12eb4d5ad.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftokimi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/950513659899780d3fd677f8907af80a2c1a440d.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zM6G-zVfbxI\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Squish</strong> 是一個小巧卻充滿魔法的模組，建立在一個簡單的核心理念上：<br>\n最可愛的事物，值得永遠保持可愛。</p>\n<p>透過 <strong>Squish</strong>，所有可馴服或被動的生物都會永久保持在牠們可愛的幼崽形態！沒有倒數計時，也不會成長，只有滿滿的迷你氛圍。🐣💗</p>\n<p>但 <strong>Squish</strong> 不僅僅是關於迷你夥伴。它也透過懷舊的製作方式，引入了一層全新的甜蜜進度系統：</p>\n<p><strong>🍬 糖果製作：</strong></p>\n<p>使用現代玩家較少觸及的遊戲機制來製作迷人的美味甜點：<br>\n營火烹飪與釀造。</p>\n<p>✨ 從<strong>永不成長</strong>的幼崽生物到以傳統方式製作的香甜糖果，<strong>Squish</strong> 為 Minecraft 帶來了一股溫柔而充滿趣味的火花！非常適合喜歡放鬆遊玩的玩家、模組整合包製作人或任何希望世界感覺更柔和的人。（<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>附註</strong></span><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">：別吃掉糖果喔，可能會感到有點噁心</span></strong> 😉）</p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>致謝</strong></span></h2>\n<p><strong>特別感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fgooberexe.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">gooberexe</a> 為糖果設計像素美術！</strong></p>\n<p><strong>特別感謝 <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/mama_native\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mama Native</a> 以及 Squish 帶來的這個美好模組構想 &lt;3</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252ftokimi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3d91f2f164c38a7aca00524f3629e101eed9db38.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
